# OlymposPass Cline rules

- Use the local Ollama model for coding tasks unless the user explicitly asks for a different provider.
- Prefer concise, production-safe code changes for this React + TypeScript + Vite project.
- When editing code, preserve existing behavior, avoid unnecessary refactors, and keep changes minimal.
- For UI work, prefer accessible React components and existing project patterns.
- For TypeScript changes, keep types explicit and avoid introducing any unless necessary.
- Before claiming completion, verify with the relevant build or test command.
- For this repository, prefer the local model for code generation, refactoring, and debugging help.
